<!-- Premiere 26.5.2, Windows, 2026-10-07: «CR Размытие полей» exported with Effects → Presets → Export Presets.
     Cut from FilterPreset to the last parameter of the mask; the bins above it (Root → Presets → TreeItem «CR Размытие полей» → FilterPresetItem) are left out.
     The mask is a SubComponent of the effect: VideoFilterComponent AE.ADBE AEMask2 «Mask2», instance «01».
     Path (ParameterID 7, ArbVideoComponentParam): base64 of int32 2, int32 1, int32 31062, byte 0, int32 2, int32 vertex count,
       then per vertex int32 0 + float32 x,y of in-tangent, vertex, out-tangent, in fractions of the frame (0..1), then byte 1 = closed.
       Here (0.02734375, 0.0472222) (0.97265625, 0.0472222) (0.97265625, 0.9527778) (0.02734375, 0.9527778) = 52.5/51 px in 1080p, 105/102 px in 4K.
     Inverted: the unnamed VideoComponentParam with ParameterID 17, StartKeyframe ...,true. Feather = ParameterID 14, Expansion = 16, Opacity = 15.
     Mask Transform: Position (9) and Anchor Point (10) in fractions, Scale Height/Width (26/27) in %, Rotation (12) in degrees.
     StartKeyframeValue and PremiereFilterPrivateData carry a Checksum attribute (not CRC32/Adler32/CRC32C of the bytes or of the base64). -->
